{#- Trends shown together (slice GR4a; scenario TS): one pack's trend items, read-only, drawn on the server and whole without a script.
    Each trend is a section under a second-level heading of its title, with its period, the day it was counted on, its marking and the
    sentence of its figures, then a chart and, after it, a table of the same figures. The chart is plain SVG with classes (the owner's
    ruling of 24 November 2026): its bars are `rect` elements placed by their own attributes, coloured by the stylesheet and never by a
    style or a fill; its text alternative is its `title`. The table has a caption, column headers (th, scope col) and a row header for
    each period (th, scope row). That some items are not shown is said once, before the trends, with no number and never which (I21).
    Nothing here is a form, a button or a control, and nothing counts: the page draws what it is given. The words are
    `server/views/packTrendsWords.ts`'s. The one link of the page's own is the way back. -#}
{% extends "layout.njk" %}
{% block content %}
<h1>{{ words.title }}</h1>
{% if view.kind == "trends" %}
<p>{{ words.lede }}</p>
<p>{{ view.pack }}</p>
<p>{{ view.standing }}</p>
{% if view.highest %}<p>{{ view.highest }}</p>
{% endif %}
{% if view.withheld %}<p class="pack-trends__withheld">{{ words.withheld }}</p>
{% endif %}
{% for trend in view.trends %}
<section class="pack-trend" aria-labelledby="pack-trend-{{ loop.index }}">
<h2 id="pack-trend-{{ loop.index }}">{{ trend.title }}</h2>
<p>{{ trend.period }}</p>
<p>{{ trend.countedOn }}</p>
<p>{{ trend.marking }}</p>
<p>{{ trend.sentence }}</p>
<svg class="pack-trend__chart" viewBox="0 0 {{ trend.chart.width }} {{ trend.chart.height }}" role="img" aria-labelledby="pack-trend-{{ loop.index }}-chart" focusable="false"><title id="pack-trend-{{ loop.index }}-chart">{{ trend.chart.label }}</title>{% for bar in trend.chart.bars %}<rect class="pack-trend__bar" x="{{ bar.x }}" y="{{ bar.y }}" width="{{ bar.width }}" height="{{ bar.height }}"></rect>{% endfor %}</svg>
<table class="table">
<caption class="caption">{{ trend.table.caption }}</caption>
<thead>
<tr>{% for column in trend.table.columns %}<th scope="col">{{ column }}</th>{% endfor %}</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
{% for row in trend.table.rows %}<tr><th scope="row">{{ row.head }}</th>{% for cell in row.cells %}<td>{{ cell }}</td>{% endfor %}</tr>
{% endfor %}</tbody>
</table>
</section>
{% else %}
<p>{{ words.noTrends }}</p>
{% endfor %}
{% elif view.kind == "ended" %}
<p role="alert">{{ ended }}</p>
{% else %}
<p role="alert">{{ words.unreadable }}</p>
{% endif %}
<p><a href="/">{{ words.back }}</a></p>
{% endblock %}
